{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》昨晚（15日）播出的露營夜爆出感人一幕！「超I人」侯建民（Zico）向心儀女神俞可程（Kanis）作出超深情告白，不但自爆當初是為了Kanis才鼓起勇氣參加節目，更坦言曾因心碎而萌生退賽念頭。Zico一番真誠剖白成功觸動Kanis，更令她當場淚崩，而一句金句更徹底撼動女神心，引發網民瘋狂集氣！\n</p>\n<h2>Zico自爆為Kanis參賽 曾因心碎萌生退賽念頭</h2>\n<p>在節目中，仍未有明確心儀對象的Kanis，希望利用獨處時間了解Zico鍾情自己的原因。Zico坦言，當初在「心跳電話亭」環節看到Kanis甜對Oscar時，對他打擊極大，更一度想過退出比賽。他進一步剖白，自己作為一個極度內向的「超I人」，之所以會參加節目，完全是為了Kanis：「其實我參加呢個節目係好冇信心，好驚架。（有乜驅使你咁驚講嘢都嚟參加？）就係因為你咯，我見到你有種好特別嘅感覺，所以我都唔理我講嘢得唔得，點都好我想（參加節目）試咗先。」</p>\n<h2>Zico金句「放棄好容易」成功搞喊Kanis</h2>\n<p>Zico的真誠剖白讓Kanis大為感動，直言：「之前我都有啲唔相信，當佢再次肯定係為我而嚟，我都有啲感動。」而當Kanis聽到Zico曾有退賽念頭時，更忍不住哭成淚人。眼見女神落淚，「直男」Zico立即抓緊機會，以堅定認真的神情表達決心，說出震撼全場的金句：「我覺得放棄一樣嘢好容易，但我唔係好鍾意放棄，就算只有一絲絲嘅希望，我都真係想試埋今次。」這份堅持的決心再次深深打動Kanis，她事後坦承：「『放棄其實好容易』，我畀佢呢句說話感動咗嘅。」</p>\n<h2>網民一面倒力撐Zico：專一男人唔係成日有</h2>\n<p>Zico的深情與專一，讓他一夜間成為網民熱捧對象，紛紛留言為他加油打氣，希望他不要放棄。網民一面倒力撐：「Zico條件好好」、「專一男人唔係成日有」、「Zico老實又成熟，值得過人世」、「好真誠」、「對話夠晒真情流露」。不少觀眾更被他的決心打動：「Zico is a very nice loyal man」、「Zico對住喜歡嘅人義無反顧」、「Zico you are a real Man」、「Zico真的值得一個機會」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_17611512166afa8449d56a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_17611512166afa8449d56a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_19966307426afa844e6972d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_19966307426afa844e6972d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_2524894396afa84551a140.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_2524894396afa84551a140.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/47_5816051156afa8459b8c27.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/47_5816051156afa8459b8c27.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_18802169916afa845f3864e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_18802169916afa845f3864e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_11141910286afa8407be506.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_11141910286afa8407be506.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_2255342006afa842520db0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_2255342006afa842520db0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_5979405846afa8429a3c38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_5979405846afa8429a3c38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_1986931456afa843455ac1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_1986931456afa843455ac1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:33:48.179935+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1209,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:48:10.826823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:27:05.654828+00:00","content_hash":"655075a0187e9da1396c39fc50e3f123208da388cf3d1fd205492fd1041e3800","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}